<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Far away our background seems with all its gifts and teaching,</l><l>Farther still, the worldly things with all their foul demand;</l><l>As the love of Jesus Christ our inmost heart is reaching,</l><l>Not a thing can move us from Christ our land.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>“I will build My church upon this rock,” said the Lord Jesus,</l><l>And we see the building of His purpose and His plan;</l><l>Setting members in the Body as Himself it pleases,</l><l>Building us together in Christ our land.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now the Lord’s recovery is everywhere proceeding,</l><l>All the churches join in one to give the Lord command:</l><l>“Speed the day when all the earth will echo with pray-reading</l><l>And with hallelujahs for Christ our land.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
